#![allow(clippy::unwrap_used, clippy::expect_used, clippy::panic)]
//! LIVE operator-control verification.
//!
//! This test starts the real `apex-control` binary (and, when
//! `APEX_API_BIN` is set, the real `apex-api` binary) on unique loopback
//! ports, signs in with real TOTP codes computed from the operator secrets,
//! creates genuinely signed ledgers through the real `apex_proof::Ledger`
//! API, and drives every capability over HTTP with a real CSRF token.
//!
//! The ledger/snapshot/invoice data is generated by this test, but every
//! ledger line is signed and chained by apex-proof; nothing is mocked.
//!
//! Run:
//! ```text
//! APEX_API_BIN=$PWD/rust/target/debug/apex-api \
//! APEX_LIVE_CLICKHOUSE_HTTP=http://127.0.0.1:18123 \
//! cargo test -p apex-control --test live_control -- --nocapture --test-threads=1
//! ```
//! Without `APEX_LIVE_CLICKHOUSE_HTTP` the ClickHouse-dependent reads are
//! exercised in their honest not-configured state; without `APEX_API_BIN`
//! the governance-delivery section is skipped.

